invariant: INV-25
file: webpki_cert.c
catches: webpki_cert_test
builds: bin/webpki_cert_test
reason: webpki_parse_certificate reads the TBS, the signature algorithm
  and the signature from the whole entry without holding them to the
  Certificate SEQUENCE's own length, so a certificate whose SEQUENCE
  ends before its signature still parses. test/webpki_cert_mutants.h's
  short-outer case objects.

--- old
    if (!x509_read_header(&r, TAG_SEQUENCE, &body_len) || body_len != rb_left(&r)) {
--- new
    if (!x509_read_header(&r, TAG_SEQUENCE, &body_len)) {
